                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2021年8月31日上午，以“心怀感恩，砥砺奋进”为主题的绍兴一中2021学年第一学期开学典礼在锡麟体育馆隆重举行。学校1980届校友、爱心人士王卫列先生，“潘之庚奖学金”设立方代表中厦集团副总经理吴玉宝先生，全体校领导出席本次典礼，全体师生参加。本次典礼由党委副书记、纪委书记孙洪亮主持。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>拼搏奋进 为国争光</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委书记、校长王琛致辞</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 108%; margin: 0px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020906236366.png" style="max-width: 100%; " /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王琛在开学致辞中首先回顾了我校2020学年在全面发展、教学质量、中考招生及办学体制机制方面的重大突破，并对全体一中学子提出三点希望：一是要有“心怀感恩，心怀梦想，为国争光”的不竭动力；二是要有“坚定信心，坚强意志，拼搏奋进”的强大自信；三是要有“精心规划，精细安排，改革创新”的科学态度。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>心怀感恩，回报社会</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王卫列先生致辞</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 108%; margin: 0px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020909347701.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020909347701.png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王卫列先生一直以来长期结对资助困难家庭大学生，助力贫困学子成长。在典礼上，他分享了自己的学习和工作经历，希望同学们常怀感恩之心，感恩父母的养育之恩，感恩老师的教育之恩，感谢绍兴这一片土地，更要感谢这个伟大的时代，并勉励同学们脚踏实地，刻苦学习，造福社会，报效祖国，担起实现中华民族伟大复兴的重任。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>自强不息，超越自我</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生代表发言</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 108%; margin: 0px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020909566933.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020909566933.png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2021年8月30日，我校蒋裕燕同学以34.69秒的优异成绩勇夺东京残奥会50米蝶泳S6比赛金牌，并在此前的预赛中以34.56秒打破世界纪录。全体师生共同观看了蒋裕燕的比赛视频，触壁夺冠的那一刻，激动人心！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作为蒋裕燕的同窗好友，金晨希同学分享介绍了她眼中的蒋裕燕。她说道，蒋裕燕在刻苦训练的同时，也不懈怠学习，甚至写得一手好书法，生活中也包容温暖，常常照顾身边的同学，感动于蒋裕燕的坚定与执着，决心要学习她不畏困难，自立自强的精神，用奋斗铸就青春。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>表彰先进，见贤思齐</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">典礼上，蒋明校长宣读了市直及以上先进教师荣誉名单。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王琛校长为杨国仁、楼立青两位满30年教龄的教师颁奖、献花。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12pt; white-space: normal; font-family: Calibri; line-height: 17.28px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020912298893.png" style="max-width: 100%; " /></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12pt; white-space: normal; font-family: Calibri; line-height: 17.28px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">                                                               宣读获奖名单</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12pt; white-space: normal; font-family: Calibri; line-height: 17.28px; text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">教学处主任冯王亮老师，年段长钟慧军老师、王月琴老师和施笑程老师分别宣读了英贤学生奖、学科竞赛个人奖、各类奖学金获奖名单，以及共青团一线和德育一线的学生先进名单。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12pt; white-space: normal; font-family: Calibri; line-height: 17.28px; text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020915133300.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020915133300.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020915137164.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020915137164.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020915133395.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020915133395.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020915151011.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020915151011.png" /></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12pt; white-space: normal; font-family: Calibri; line-height: 17.28px; text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
</span>
</p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12pt; white-space: normal; font-family: Calibri; line-height: 17.28px; text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">全体嘉宾领导为获奖的优秀学生颁奖，会场内掌声经久不息，优秀学生的领奖将持续激励着同学们继续积极进取，奋勇争先。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020910434071.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020910434071.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020910529361.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020910529361.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020910525392.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020910525392.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020911065698.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020911065698.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020911095150.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020911095150.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020911143986.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020911143986.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020911140783.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020911140783.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020911277505.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020911277505.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020911304213.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020911304213.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/9/202109020911457972.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202109020911457972.png" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在热烈的掌声中，本次开学典礼圆满落幕。一中学子带着满腔热情，怀揣梦想开始了新的征程。新的学期承载新的希望，相信绍兴一中全体师生定会策马扬鞭，砥砺奋进，齐心协力，共同见证属于一中新的骄傲和辉煌！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
